   [{:id "70c753b1-467b-4504-a5ab-6099eeed3d8a"
     :type :definition
     :name "type-publication"
     :lang :en
     :major 1
     :minor 0
     :title "Publication"
     :text
     "a set of documents in one language, prepared together and then published at once; it records for good where each version it publishes comes from.\n\nA publication is not challenged: it asserts nothing by itself. What holds together is carried by the documents that cite each other, and a disagreement is taken up with them. To correct a published document, its author publishes a new version of it in a new publication."
